  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:07.920" end="00:13.960" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Oh)</p>
      <p begin="00:13.960" end="00:15.460" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Oh)</p>
      <p begin="00:15.000" end="00:18.070" ttm:agent="v1">No smoke with no fire</p>
      <p begin="00:18.070" end="00:20.730" ttm:agent="v1">No silence if there's no sound</p>
      <p begin="00:20.730" end="00:23.960" ttm:agent="v1">One way or another</p>
      <p begin="00:23.960" end="00:26.760" ttm:agent="v1">You're going to put me out</p>
      <p begin="00:26.760" end="00:29.610" ttm:agent="v1">Drinks flowing like water</p>
      <p begin="00:29.610" end="00:32.890" ttm:agent="v1">Too drunk to turn off the light</p>
      <p begin="00:32.890" end="00:35.430" ttm:agent="v1">Stay under the covers</p>
      <p begin="00:35.430" end="00:38.320" ttm:agent="v1">Who knows how we'll end the night</p>
      <p begin="00:38.320" end="00:41.670" ttm:agent="v1">Just don't hang your hopes on me</p>
      <p begin="00:41.670" end="00:44.320" ttm:agent="v1">I wanna feel something</p>
      <p begin="00:44.320" end="00:46.530" ttm:agent="v1">God, you look so pretty</p>
      <p begin="00:46.530" end="00:50.940" ttm:agent="v1">When you tell me that you love me</p>
      <p begin="00:50.940" end="00:53.830" ttm:agent="v1">I wish that I could lie</p>
      <p begin="00:53.830" end="00:56.790" ttm:agent="v1">But my mind gets in the way</p>
      <p begin="00:56.790" end="00:59.790" ttm:agent="v1">I know you think that I'm</p>
      <p begin="00:59.790" end="01:02.490" ttm:agent="v1">Always way too self-aware</p>
      <p begin="01:02.490" end="01:05.560" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, we could never be together</p>
      <p begin="01:05.560" end="01:08.560" ttm:agent="v1">But it's nice to play pretend</p>
      <p begin="01:08.560" end="01:11.630" ttm:agent="v1">I wish that I could liе</p>
      <p begin="01:11.630" end="01:14.340" ttm:agent="v1">But I'm way too self-aware</p>
      <p begin="01:14.340" end="01:16.140" ttm:agent="v1">Mood swings like thе weather</p>
      <p begin="01:16.140" end="01:17.720" ttm:agent="v1">Body's under pressure</p>
      <p begin="01:17.720" end="01:20.670" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, I love the way you're using your imagination</p>
      <p begin="01:20.670" end="01:22.180" ttm:agent="v1">Laws of attraction</p>
      <p begin="01:22.180" end="01:25.500" ttm:agent="v1">Put 'em into practice</p>
      <p begin="01:25.500" end="01:29.140" ttm:agent="v1">Just don't hang your hopes on me</p>
      <p begin="01:29.140" end="01:31.700" ttm:agent="v1">I wanna feel something</p>
      <p begin="01:31.700" end="01:33.970" ttm:agent="v1">God, you look so pretty</p>
      <p begin="01:33.970" end="01:38.360" ttm:agent="v1">When you tell me that you love me</p>
      <p begin="01:38.360" end="01:41.370" ttm:agent="v1">I wish that I could lie</p>
      <p begin="01:41.370" end="01:44.370" ttm:agent="v1">But my mind gets in the way</p>
      <p begin="01:44.370" end="01:47.130" ttm:agent="v1">I know you think that I'm</p>
      <p begin="01:47.130" end="01:49.900" ttm:agent="v1">Always way too self-aware</p>
      <p begin="01:49.900" end="01:53.330" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, we could never be together</p>
      <p begin="01:53.330" end="01:56.200" ttm:agent="v1">But it's nice to play pretend</p>
      <p begin="01:56.200" end="01:59.120" ttm:agent="v1">I wish that I could lie</p>
      <p begin="01:59.120" end="02:02.500" ttm:agent="v1">But I'm way too self-aware</p>
      <p begin="02:02.500" end="02:10.500" ttm:agent="v1">♪</p>
      <p begin="02:13.130" end="02:16.640" ttm:agent="v1">Just don't hang your hopes on me</p>
      <p begin="02:16.640" end="02:19.240" ttm:agent="v1">I wanna feel something</p>
      <p begin="02:19.240" end="02:21.410" ttm:agent="v1">God, you look so pretty</p>
      <p begin="02:21.410" end="02:28.660" ttm:agent="v1">When you tell me that you love me</p>
      <p begin="02:28.660" end="02:31.780" ttm:agent="v1">I wish that I could lie</p>
      <p begin="02:31.780" end="02:34.760" ttm:agent="v1">But my mind gets in the way</p>
      <p begin="02:34.760" end="02:37.590" ttm:agent="v1">I know you think that I'm</p>
      <p begin="02:37.590" end="02:40.180" ttm:agent="v1">Always way too self-aware</p>
      <p begin="02:40.180" end="02:43.460" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, we could never be together</p>
      <p begin="02:43.460" end="02:46.480" ttm:agent="v1">But it's nice to play pretend</p>
      <p begin="02:46.480" end="02:49.540" ttm:agent="v1">I wish that I could lie</p>
      <p begin="02:49.540" end="02:51.770" ttm:agent="v1">But I'm way too self-aware</p>
      <p begin="02:51.770" end="02:55.770" ttm:agent="v1"/>
